ot_kt", "label": "ui/AppRoot.kt", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "Android/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Splash -> Onboarding -> Auth -> Biometric -> Main router."}, {"id": "android_readme_m0_scaffold", "label": "M0 - Scaffold", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Android/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Gradle, Compose, Hilt, Room, Firebase BOM, Vico, Material3, brand design system portu, manifest, splash, app icons."}, {"id": "android_readme_m1_data_model_persistence", "label": "M1 - Data model + persistence", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Android/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Room ile 7 entity (Transaction, Category, User, AppSettings, Budget, Goal, NotificationRecord). Migration 1->2. Repositories. \u0130lk a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131\u015f seed 15 default kategori + AppSettings sat\u0131r\u0131."}, {"id": "android_readme_m2_authentication", "label": "M2 - Authentication", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Android/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Email/password sign-up+sign-in, Google Sign-In via Credential Manager, password reset. Onboarding 3-ekran pager. AppRoot router. \u0130lk a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131\u015f \u0130ngilizce locale."}, {"id": "android_readme_m3_transactions_crud_firestore_sync", "label": "M3 - Transactions CRUD + Firestore sync", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Android/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Y\u0131l/ay/g\u00fcn gruplu transaction listesi, ModalBottomSheet ile ekle/d\u00fczenle/sil, tab bar'da FAB. Firestore'a write-through. Sign-in sonras\u0131 fetchAndSync ile pull."}, {"id": "android_readme_m4_dashboard_stats", "label": "M4 - Dashboard + Stats", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Android/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Net balance hero, g\u00fcnl\u00fck ak\u0131\u015f line chart (Vico), top kategoriler, son i\u015flemler, dashboard'da AI insight kart\u0131. Stats donut (Compose Canvas), income/expense toggle, kategori breakdown, MoM delta."}, {"id": "android_readme_m5_budgi_ai", "label": "M5 - Budgi AI", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Android/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rule-based insight engine portu (5 kural), Gemini 2.0 Flash chat client, kullan\u0131c\u0131/asistan balonlu chat UI + insight kartlar\u0131 + typing indicator + ilk-g\u00f6nderim consent gate."}, {"id": "android_readme_m6_settings", "label": "M6 - Settings", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Android/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ayarlar ModalBottomSheet \u2014 Profile, Premium, Preferences (tema/dil/currency picker), Security (biometric+hide amounts), Data (backup export/import), Notifications, Support, Account. androidx.biometric ile lock screen."}, {"id": "android_readme_m7_notifications", "label": "M7 - Notifications", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Android/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "BudgetellaMessagingService (FirebaseMessagingService), her push'u NotificationRecord olarak kal\u0131c\u0131 saklar, system tray'e post eder, deep link destekler. NotificationInboxScreen mark-read/mark-all-as-read."}, {"id": "android_readme_m8_paywall_stub", "label": "M8 - Paywall stub", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Android/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Compose paywall \u2014 hero, feature list, monthly/yearly toggle, CTA. Stub SubscriptionRepository her zaman isPremium=false d\u00f6ner. Play Billing impl TODO olarak i\u015faretli."}, {"id": "android_readme_todo_apple_sign_in_on_android", "label": "TODO: Apple Sign-In on Android", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "Android/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Firebase OIDC web flow + Apple Developer Service ID konfig\u00fcrasyonu gerekiyor; v1 i\u00e7in bloklay\u0131c\u0131 de\u011fil, Google+Email ayn\u0131 auth ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131 kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131yor."}, {"id": "android_readme_todo_play_billing_v7_implementation", "label": "TODO: Play Billing v7 implementation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "Android/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "SubscriptionRepository stub, her zaman false d\u00f6ner; ger\u00e7ek Play Billing client'\u0131 ba\u011flamak i\u00e7in app'in Play Console'a (en az internal testing) y\u00fcklenmesi ve product ID'lerin onaylanmas\u0131 gerekiyor."}, {"id": "android_readme_todo_glance_widget", "label": "TODO: Glance widget", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "Android/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "iOS WidgetKit'i yans\u0131tan ana ekran widget'\u0131 hen\u00fcz implement edilmedi; v1.1 item'\u0131 olarak i\u015faretli."}, {"id": "android_readme_todo_voice_camera_transaction_entry", "label": "TODO: Voice / camera transaction entry", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "Android/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "iOS FAB blob men\u00fcs\u00fc voice+camera modlar\u0131 sunuyor; Android FAB sadece manuel sheet a\u00e7\u0131yor. Voice i\u00e7in Google Speech-to-Text, kamera/fi\u015f i\u00e7in ML Kit Vision gerekiyor; v1.1+."}, {"id": "android_readme_todo_recurring_transactions", "label": "TODO: Recurring transactions", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "Android/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u015eema haz\u0131r (isRecurring, recurringInterval vb.) ama tekrarlayan transaction olu\u015fturma/template UI'\u0131 hen\u00fcz yok."}, {"id": "android_readme_todo_achievements_subscription_history", "label": "TODO: Achievements + Subscription history", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "Android/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bu iki entity Room \u015femas\u0131na hen\u00fcz eklenmedi (M8.x + M9)."}, {"id": "android_readme_todo_true_account_deletion", "label": "TODO: True account deletion", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "Android/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mevcut 'Delete account' Firestore'u siliyor + sign out yap\u0131yor ama Firebase Auth kayd\u0131n\u0131 silmiyor (recent re-auth gerektiriyor, AuthRepository hen\u00fcz expose etmiyor). iOS ayn\u0131 workaround'u kullan\u0131yor."}, {"id": "android_readme_manual_non_coding_tasks", "label": "Manual (non-coding) tasks", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Android/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "SHA-1 fingerprint Firebase Console'a eklendi, google-services.json eklendi, GEMINI_API_KEY ayarlanmal\u0131, biometric lock ger\u00e7ek cihazda test edilmeli, Play Console upload sonras\u0131 Play Billing tamamlanmal\u0131."}, {